{"body":"This pull request addresses the use of deprecated `Buffer` constructors in several runtime dependencies by applying targeted patches and adding automated tests to ensure compliance. It also introduces `patch-package` as a dependency and configures it to run automatically after installation.\r\n\r\n**Dependency modernization and maintenance:**\r\n\r\n* Added `patch-package` as a dependency and configured it to run automatically after install via the `postinstall` script in `package.json`. This ensures that necessary patches are always applied to dependencies after installation.\r\n\r\n**Patching runtime dependencies to avoid deprecated Buffer usage:**\r\n\r\n* Added patch files for `binary`, `buffers`, `tunnel`, and `unzip-stream` packages to replace deprecated `new Buffer()` and similar patterns with the recommended `Buffer.from()` and `Buffer.alloc()` APIs, ensuring compatibility with newer Node.js versions and preventing deprecation warnings or errors. \r\n\r\n**Testing and validation:**\r\n\r\n* Introduced a new test suite (`__tests__/dependencies.test.ts`) that verifies the patched dependencies (`unzip-stream`, `binary`, `buffers`, and `tunnel`) do not trigger deprecated Buffer warnings or errors when run with strict deprecation flags, ensuring the effectiveness of the applied patches.","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T10:25:12Z","authors":[{"email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","login":"Copilot","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},{"email":"37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTA3MTkw","login":"mbianchidev","name":"mbianchidev"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-18T10:25:12Z","messageBody":"Co-authored-by: mbianchidev <37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"Patch deprecated Buffer usage in unzip stream","oid":"9841fbdfa32a736aebaa9a35323ac1d9859dc369"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T10:25:49Z","authors":[{"email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","login":"Copilot","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},{"email":"37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTA3MTkw","login":"mbianchidev","name":"mbianchidev"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-18T10:25:49Z","messageBody":"Co-authored-by: mbianchidev <37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"Regenerate action bundle with safe Buffer allocation","oid":"84cd2478d740b17cf8aaeabaa32bedf1c3066132"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T10:27:47Z","authors":[{"email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","login":"Copilot","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},{"email":"37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTA3MTkw","login":"mbianchidev","name":"mbianchidev"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-18T10:27:47Z","messageBody":"Co-authored-by: mbianchidev <37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"Remove remaining deprecated Buffer constructors","oid":"84bc4fbe5815e7c977f636ef34580be2d2b3b9b9"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T10:29:36Z","authors":[{"email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","login":"Copilot","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},{"email":"37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTA3MTkw","login":"mbianchidev","name":"mbianchidev"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-18T10:29:36Z","messageBody":"Co-authored-by: mbianchidev <37507190+mbianchidev@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"Expand deprecated Buffer regression coverage","oid":"dd5145a584bdd00089de1807fe7b1f9036d53e2f"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T11:40:50Z","authors":[{"email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","login":"Copilot","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-18T11:40:50Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Fix production patch installs and dependency regression coverage","oid":"bff21492cde8b4ea9357090c2e07aef38249be33"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T13:29:39Z","authors":[{"email":"37507190+mbianc